(The RivetRegistry contract implements a registry for ML-DSA-87 attested cryptographic compatibility reports with) Tj
T* (strong authentication mechanisms using QoreChain's PQC precompiles. The contract has good security practices) Tj
T* (including replay protection, domain separation, and proper access control. However, there are some) Tj
T* (medium-severity concerns regarding potential privilege escalation through key revocation bypass and missing input) Tj
T* (validation for URI lengths. The contract also suffers from unbounded storage growth which could become) Tj
T* (problematic over time.) Tj
